# `account.state`

Ship Cloud account snapshot — logged_out / pending / logged_in. Operator-only (require_operator, S6, #124).

**Policy** — command `[C3_CRITICAL]`. Capability `ship.account.read`.

## Arguments

None.

## Returns

`AccountState` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `status` | `string` |
| `user_id` | `string` |
| `state_id` | `string` |
| `me` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call account.state --json '{}'
```

Kind: command.

## Example response

```json
{
  "status": "LOGGED_IN",
  "user_id": "usr_7Fk2Qd",
  "me": {
    "id": "usr_7Fk2Qd",
    "name": "Ada Lovelace",
    "email": "ada@getship.dev",
    "image": ""
  }
}
```
